{"parse": {"title": "世界上最小的涟漪-01", "pageid": 147251, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BA%B3%E8%A5%BF%E7%B4%A2%E6%96%AF%C2%B7%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E4%B8%8A%E6%9C%80%E5%B0%8F%E7%9A%84%E6%B6%9F%E6%BC%AA\" title=\"纳西索斯·世界上最小的涟漪\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">世界上最小的涟漪-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E4%B8%8A%E6%9C%80%E5%B0%8F%E7%9A%84%E6%B6%9F%E6%BC%AA-02\" title=\"世界上最小的涟漪-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">世界上最小的涟漪</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.80.81.E5.88.AB.E7.9A.84.E6.B0.B4.E4.BB.99\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"送别的水仙\">送别的水仙</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 送别的水仙</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Friend's Departure</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泉水宁芙I：</div><div>多里斯……温柔、智慧的多里斯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泉水宁芙I：</div><div>她安然地度过漫长的一世，愿她在鲜花与流水的陪伴下，去往宁静的彼岸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泉水宁芙I：</div><div>那里春日常驻，天气晴朗，光辉与微风徜徉，日晒后的湖水温暖而清澈……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-senlin.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"senlin\"><img alt=\"senlin\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-senlin.png/600px-Cg-senlin.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-senlin.png/900px-Cg-senlin.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-senlin.png/1200px-Cg-senlin.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泉水宁芙I：</div><div>多里斯她……呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>悼词被止不住的呜咽打断，伫立在湖边的精灵掩面哭泣起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308821.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-308821.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308821.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308821.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-308821.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308821.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-308821.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308821.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泉水宁芙II：</div><div>多里斯的生命是圆满的。她为我们指引了一条明路——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308821.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-308821.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308821.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308821.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-308821.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308821.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-308821.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308821.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泉水宁芙II：</div><div>只要我们始终追求宁静的心灵与平静的生活，我们就可以和多里斯一样，抵达那圆满的彼岸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308821.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-308821.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308821.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308821.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-308821.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308821.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-308821.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308821.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泉水宁芙II：</div><div>泉水宁芙的身体如此脆弱，生命又如此漫长……多里斯，她给予了我们唯一的、正确的指引。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>流水潺潺，多里斯的身体漂浮在水面之上，轻盈浅白的花瓣簇拥着她的面庞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>指引之人已安然阖上双眼，如同抵达永恒的梦乡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308821.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-308821.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308821.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308821.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-308821.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308821.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-308821.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308821.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泉水宁芙II：</div><div>让我们为多里斯歌唱吧，用歌声为她送别，愿她前往那乐土。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一场宁静的葬礼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宁芙们手握着手，围绕在沉睡的族长身旁，轻轻吟唱起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>优美的歌声如同柔和的轻纱，笼罩在多里斯的身体上——尽管她已不再有任何的回应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-315720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-315720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-315720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>呃……呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-315720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-315720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-315720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>呜呜……多里斯……呜呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>唯有一个宁芙，她的歌声算不上十分和谐。她啜泣着，几乎放声大哭起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>我知道这一天总会到来，可是……可是多里斯，一想到接下来的日子里都不能和你说话……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>以后的时间太难熬、太可怕了……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泉水宁芙I：</div><div>纳西索斯，我们有相同的感受，让我们宁静地……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>多里斯，你……你还没看到我赢下比赛呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不合时宜的话使泉水宁芙们大惊失色，他们看向纳西索斯，目光中带着惊讶、不解和少许愠怒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泉水宁芙I：</div><div>纳西索斯！现在不是说这个的时候！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泉水宁芙I：</div><div>而且，泉水宁芙怎么可以去参加比赛呢？你实在是太过分了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泉水宁芙I：</div><div>多里斯应该和你说过吧？你连多里斯的教诲都不听……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>多里斯她才没这样说过！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泉水宁芙I：</div><div>纳西索斯！你……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这个无礼又莽撞的同族使她怒火中烧，她几乎无法继续说下去，只是瞪大了双眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308821.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-308821.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308821.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308821.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-308821.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308821.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-308821.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308821.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泉水宁芙II：</div><div>好了，好了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308821.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-308821.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308821.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308821.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-308821.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308821.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-308821.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308821.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泉水宁芙II：</div><div>纳西索斯，我知道你很依赖多里斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308821.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-308821.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308821.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308821.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-308821.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308821.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-308821.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308821.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泉水宁芙II：</div><div>而多里斯正是因为重视且追求平静的生活，才能陪伴我们如此长的岁月。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308821.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-308821.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308821.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308821.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-308821.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308821.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-308821.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308821.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泉水宁芙II：</div><div>至少在这个时刻，让我们平静地送别多里斯吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>葬礼仍在进行，年纪稍长的宁芙轻声制止了这插曲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她再也没有反驳，只是沉默地擦干眼泪，站到了一旁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>很快，泉水宁芙们又握住了彼此的掌蹼，轻声唱诵起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>纳西索斯低下头，任由自己的眼泪在送别的歌声中垂落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眼泪一颗颗落下，湖水之中泛起阵阵涟漪。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_bg_05.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_bg_05\"><img alt=\"3_9_bg_05\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-3_9_bg_05.png/600px-Cg-3_9_bg_05.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-3_9_bg_05.png/900px-Cg-3_9_bg_05.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/Cg-3_9_bg_05.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_bg_05.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-315714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-315714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-315714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>呜……呜……呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653316.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-653316.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653316.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653316.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-653316.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653316.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-653316.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653316.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">忒弥斯：</div><div>我宣布，本场比赛的胜者——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"653302.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"653302.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/32/HeadIconSmall-653302.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-653302.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">忒弥斯：</div><div>赫多涅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315715.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-315715.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315715.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315715.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-315715.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315715.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/40/HeadIconSmall-315715.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315715.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>呼……差……差太多了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她几乎趴在地上，沙子沾满了全身，狼狈地试图撑起自己的身体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>汗水从额角滑落，在翻涌的浪潮之中没有引起任何涟漪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/HeadIconSmall-315620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/HeadIconSmall-315620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/HeadIconSmall-315620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>一个泉水宁芙……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/HeadIconSmall-315620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/HeadIconSmall-315620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/HeadIconSmall-315620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>你为何来参赛？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315722.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-315722.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315722.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315722.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-315722.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315722.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-315722.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315722.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>呼……呼……嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抬起头，一举获得胜利的赢家就站在她的眼前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>红发的君主饶有兴趣地看着脚下的宁芙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>我记得泉水宁芙只在淡水之中活动，这么久了，你们从来不涉足岛上的赛事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>不过，即使你们来了，胜算也微乎其微。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>所以，告诉我——你为何而来？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>君主的语气并不轻蔑，她只是俯下身体，靠近了宁芙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>出于单纯的兴趣，领袖为一个失败者驻足片刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-315712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-315712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-315712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>不为什么！赫多涅……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-315711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-315711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-315711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:88%\">殿下……</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>失败者心有不甘，碍于那君主的地位，又被迫加上尊称。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304127.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-304127.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304127.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304127.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-304127.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304127.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-304127.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304127.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>哈哈！不错的回答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304127.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-304127.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304127.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304127.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-304127.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304127.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-304127.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304127.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>希望你下次会有进步，至少挺进排行榜，让我知道你的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她转身要走，一个小小的插曲，并不值得她停留太久。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-315712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-315712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-315712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>纳西索斯！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-315712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-315712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-315712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>我的名字是纳西索斯！你……您并不需要等到下次再知道我的名字！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那个小不点艰难地起身，倔强地昂着头，只有海风好心地传送她的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-315601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-315601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-315601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">赫多涅：</div><div>哦——这可不够，你得做点什么，我才能记住你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那红色的身影毫不留恋，彻底离开了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_bg_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_bg_13\"><img alt=\"3_9_bg_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/Cg-3_9_bg_13.png/600px-Cg-3_9_bg_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/Cg-3_9_bg_13.png/900px-Cg-3_9_bg_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/Cg-3_9_bg_13.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_bg_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-315712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-315712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/HeadIconSmall-315712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>啊——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>渺小的拳头砸在了沙滩上。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-senlin.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"senlin\"><img alt=\"senlin\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-senlin.png/600px-Cg-senlin.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-senlin.png/900px-Cg-senlin.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-senlin.png/1200px-Cg-senlin.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-315711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-315711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-315711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>赫多涅和壁画上的一点儿都不一样，她讨厌极了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泉水宁芙I：</div><div>嘘！嘘！纳西索斯！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泉水宁芙I：</div><div>你不能……你不能这样……直呼赫多涅殿下的名讳！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>这有什么关系呀！反正她又听不见！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_at_02.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_at_02\"><img alt=\"3_9_at_02\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Cg-3_9_at_02.png/600px-Cg-3_9_at_02.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Cg-3_9_at_02.png/900px-Cg-3_9_at_02.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Cg-3_9_at_02.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_at_02.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泉水宁芙I：</div><div>你怎么知道？在这火山岛上，赫多涅殿下的能力是没有任何限制的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泉水宁芙I：</div><div>因为她的庇护，我们才能安全地生活在这里……你应该对赫多涅殿下保持尊敬！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-senlin.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"senlin\"><img alt=\"senlin\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-senlin.png/600px-Cg-senlin.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-senlin.png/900px-Cg-senlin.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-senlin.png/1200px-Cg-senlin.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>所以你到底是害怕我们的对话被她听到，还是感激她收留了我们呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>如果是前者，你大可放心！因为赫多涅并没有这么无聊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>族中最矮小的那个宁芙坚定地仰着头，几乎像在述说一个真理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-300420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泉水宁芙I：</div><div>啊——！纳西索斯，你为什么——你为什么总能这样强词夺理？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>满脸通红的同伴被她气得几乎跳起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308821.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-308821.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308821.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308821.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-308821.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308821.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-308821.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308821.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泉水宁芙II：</div><div>纳西索斯——多里斯族长找你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>我马上就去！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>受到族长的召见，她又满心欢喜，像只翩跹的蝴蝶飞走了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_9_bg_21.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_9_bg_21\"><img alt=\"3_9_bg_21\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-3_9_bg_21.png/600px-Cg-3_9_bg_21.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-3_9_bg_21.png/900px-Cg-3_9_bg_21.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-3_9_bg_21.png/1200px-Cg-3_9_bg_21.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>多里斯，多里斯！你听我说！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>我今天第一次和赫多涅说话了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>还是她先朝我搭话的呢——虽然我这次没有战胜她，但想必在她眼里，我也是一个不可忽视的劲敌！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宁芙滔滔不绝，习惯性地粉饰一些不太完美的事实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>多里斯，你真该来看看我的首战，其他人都不愿踏出湖水一步……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她暗自庆幸多里斯没有真的成为这场比赛的观众。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>只有你能理解我为什么这样做！我们有共同的秘密，对吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>纳西索斯，我的孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那敬爱的族中长辈声调温柔，孩子趴在她的膝上，头发正被轻抚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>我当然希望亲眼去看你的比赛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>不仅如此，错过你的任何变化，对我来说都是遗憾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>唔……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这样的重视使她开心地眯起眼睛，蹭了蹭长辈的手掌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"657501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"657501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-657501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-657501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多里斯：</div><div>不过……纳西索斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的声音缓了下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-315713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-315713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-315713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>那一天，我第一次知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-315713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-315713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-315713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>多里斯已经快要走到她生命的尽头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"315713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-315713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-315713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"315713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-315713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-315713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-315713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-315713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳西索斯：</div><div>再怎么漫长的生命……都会有尽头。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "世界上最小的涟漪-01"}}